==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|EX Unseen Forces|Jynx|28}} from the {{TCG|EX Unseen Forces}} expansion.
*'''Dazzle Dance''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Ruby & Sapphire|Kirlia|35}} from the {{TCG|EX Ruby & Sapphire}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

